<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72650" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰστέος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">, ʽφέρὠ</span>”
				<i>to be borne,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OC</u>
					1360
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰστέον</span>”
				<i>one must bear,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					769
				</span></i>
			 ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρὺ μέν, οἰστέον δ᾽ ὅμως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Hel.</u>
					268
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				531.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>one must get,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κέρδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					310
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>one must pay,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φόρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Isoc.
					14.10
				</span></i>
			.</div>
